\pard\sl-240\slmult1 \cf1\lang1033\fs28\f0 Microwave Man!\fs24 \par
\cf2 You are merely 2 inches tall, and more than just a little confused.  You just woke up from a long sleep to find yourself lying in a big, dirty, empty room.  You're buck naked and beside you is a pile of aluminum clothing and a shard of glass.  You slowly look around evaluate your surroundings, realizing that you're in a microwave.\par
\par
Now you have to get out, before someone sticks something in there and bombards you with the radioactive waves that will come with it.  Hurry, if you don't get out soon you'll suffocate!\par
\cf1 \par
take clothes\par
\cf2 You pick up some aluminum clothes.\par
\cf1 \par
wear clothes\par
\cf2 You put on some aluminum clothes.\par
\cf1 \par
take glass\par
\cf2 You pick up the shard of glass.\par
\cf1 \par
bang on door\par
\cf2 You bang on the microwave door, praying for someone to notice you.  A few moments pass, and a large hand opens the door!  The man which opens the door looks at you, and smirks.  "Ah, so it's my old enemy the little little man!" he says with a cackle.  The man puts a coffee mug in the microwave and closes the door.  Coffee Man closes the door and begins to press buttons on the microwave.\par
\cf1 \par
chop door\par
\cf2 You cut a big gash in the microwave door's protective cover.\par
\cf1 \par
hold up glass\par
\cf2 You hold up the shard of glass, hoping the radioactive beams about to bombard you will reflect off it and blast down the door.  You grit your teeth as Coffee Man presses some buttons on the microwave and presses 'START'.  Yes!  The beams shoot at you but bounce off of the glass!  You steer the beams in the direction of the microwave door... and the door pops open!  The microwave shuts itself off when the door opens!  Coffee Man is halfway through pressing the buttons!\par
\cf1 \par
take gun\par
\cf2 You take a small pistol from some aluminum clothes.\par
\cf1 \par
south\par
\cf2 You move south.\par
The kitchen, a wide and wonderful place compared to the dark isolation of the microwave.  There's a counter, a ceramic floor, a stove, a sink, and various other fixtures in a kitchen (you know what a kitchen looks like!).  Coffee Man is here.\par
\cf0\fs16 \par
